(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
